    "payload": {
      "artifact_ids": [],
      "call_id": "call_JJwKkGITXR1Kgn7ZAFTLRp3G",
      "content": "# Numeric utilities contract\r\nImplement two independent interfaces; invalid inputs must throw IllegalArgumentException.\r\nstats.Mean.rounded(long[]): reject null/empty. Compute the arithmetic mean rounded to the nearest long with HALF_EVEN.\r\nIntermediate sum must not overflow even for Long.MAX_VALUE and Long.MIN_VALUE arrays. Do not mutate the input.\r\nretry.Delay.millis(long base, int attempt, long cap): require base>=1, attempt>=0, cap>=base.\r\nReturn min(cap, base * 2^attempt), avoiding overflow and avoiding work proportional to very large attempt values.\r\nRead tests/GateTest.java. Preserve signatures, README.md, verifier and tests. Integrate both modules and run\r\npowershell.exe -NoProfile -File ./verify.ps1 in the main checkout.\r\n",
      "error_code": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "status": "success"
    },
    "created_at": 1790492488.1087596
